<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN: combat hormone -->
  <VV_CombatHormoneJelly.label>戰斗激素</VV_CombatHormoneJelly.label>
  <!-- EN: It is in a state where combat hormones that greatly enhance the Vivi's inherent aggressiveness have been injected. Combat-related skills are enhanced, and sensitivity to pain is reduced; they do not panic at the sight of fire, but they tire very quickly and become hungry. -->
  <VV_CombatHormoneJelly.description>注射戰斗激素大大增強了薇薇原有的攻擊性。戰斗相關能力增強，對疼痛的敏感性降低；他們不再會一看到火焰就恐慌，但他們會加速疲勞，更易饑餓。</VV_CombatHormoneJelly.description>
  <!-- EN: Temporarily prevents mental break caused by the 'Fire Terror' gene. -->
  <VV_CombatHormoneJelly.stages.0.extraTooltip>暫時防止由恐火癥基因引發的精神崩潰。</VV_CombatHormoneJelly.stages.0.extraTooltip>
  
  <!-- EN: high on ice tea -->
  <VV_CoolingFloralTea.label>冰茶興奮</VV_CoolingFloralTea.label>
  <!-- EN: Drunk ice flowering tea, making their body more resistant to heat. -->
  <VV_CoolingFloralTea.description>喝下冰花茶抵御炎熱。</VV_CoolingFloralTea.description>
  
  <!-- EN: relaxed on flowering tea -->
  <VV_FloralTea.label>花茶放松</VV_FloralTea.label>
  <!-- EN: Drunk flowering tea and are now in a serene state of mind. -->
  <VV_FloralTea.description>喝了花茶，讓心情平靜。</VV_FloralTea.description>
  
  <!-- EN: flower scent -->
  <VV_FlowerScent.label>花香</VV_FlowerScent.label>
  <!-- EN: Emitting a floral scent from body. It becomes easier to focus psychic energy. -->
  <VV_FlowerScent.description>正散發出花香。</VV_FlowerScent.description>
  
  <!-- EN: royal jelly effect -->
  <VV_RoyalJelly.label>蜂王漿</VV_RoyalJelly.label>
  <!-- EN: The effects of royal jelly slow down aging. In the case of child Vivi, their bodies are transforming into Royal Vivi.\n\nConsuming additional royal jelly will not stack the effects. -->
  <VV_RoyalJelly.description>蜂王漿具有延緩衰老的功效。令幼體薇薇向皇家薇薇轉化。\n\n蜂王漿效果不會疊加。</VV_RoyalJelly.description>
  
  <!-- EN: learning boost -->
  <VV_ViviGrowthBoost.label>學習促進</VV_ViviGrowthBoost.label>
  <!-- EN: Gain additional bonuses to global learning speed and growth point. -->
  <VV_ViviGrowthBoost.description>獲得全局學習速度和成長點的額外加成。</VV_ViviGrowthBoost.description>
  
  <!-- EN: high on warm tea -->
  <VV_WarmingFloralTea.label>熱茶興奮</VV_WarmingFloralTea.label>
  <!-- EN: Drunk warm flowering tea, making their body more resistant to the cold. -->
  <VV_WarmingFloralTea.description>喝下熱花茶抵御嚴寒。</VV_WarmingFloralTea.description>
  
</LanguageData>